    "answer": {
      "short": "One symbol represents 4 surfboards. Monday: 2 symbols; Tuesday: 3 and a half; Wednesday: 1 and a half; Thursday: 2 and a half; Friday: 3.",
      "worked": "Divide each value by the key value, 4.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Monday}&=8\\div4=2\\\\\\text{Tuesday}&=14\\div4=3.5\\\\\\text{Wednesday}&=6\\div4=1.5\\\\\\text{Thursday}&=10\\div4=2.5\\\\\\text{Friday}&=12\\div4=3\\end{align*}$$\nA half symbol represents 2 surfboards. Draw equal-sized, equally spaced symbols in aligned rows and include the key.",
